From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukasz M <lukasz1992m+openwrt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Oct 2025 15:58:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: npu: Add PON WAN mode support for PPE init

Allow NPU PPE initialization to support both Ethernet (QDMA_WAN_ETHER)
and PON/XDSL (QDMA_WAN_PON_XDSL) WAN modes. The WAN mode is now
configurable via npu->wan_mode set by the caller before ppe_init().

Signed-off-by: Lukasz M <lukasz1992m+openwrt@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c  | 5 ++++-
 include/linux/soc/airoha/airoha_offload.h | 1 +
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
@@ -343,7 +343,10 @@ static int airoha_npu_ppe_init(struct ai
 	ppe_data->func_type = NPU_OP_SET;
 	ppe_data->func_id = PPE_FUNC_SET_WAIT_HWNAT_INIT;
 	ppe_data->init_info.ppe_type = PPE_TYPE_L2B_IPV4_IPV6;
-	ppe_data->init_info.wan_mode = QDMA_WAN_ETHER;
+	if (npu->wan_mode)
+		ppe_data->init_info.wan_mode = npu->wan_mode;
+	else
+		ppe_data->init_info.wan_mode = QDMA_WAN_ETHER;
 
 	err = airoha_npu_send_msg(npu, NPU_FUNC_PPE, ppe_data,
 				  sizeof(*ppe_data));
--- a/include/linux/soc/airoha/airoha_offload.h
+++ b/include/linux/soc/airoha/airoha_offload.h
@@ -177,6 +177,7 @@ struct airoha_npu {
 
 	int irqs[NPU_NUM_IRQ];
 
+	u8 wan_mode;
 	struct airoha_foe_stats __iomem *stats;
 
 	struct {
